    "highlights": "Links and interactive textual elements leverage a 1px border underline with a 4px offset (`.decoration-1 .underline-offset-4`) for a clean, editorial interactive highlight.",
    "insights": [
      "The typography system relies heavily on variable fonts (`arcadia` and `arcadiaDisplay`) to utilize hyper-specific custom weights (360, 420, 480, 530) rather than standard 400/500 breakpoints, achieving meticulously balanced visual hierarchy.",
      "Tiempos, an elegant serif, is employed strategically for editorial layouts and subheadings (often italicized), providing a sophisticated counterpoint to the highly functional and modern Arcadia sans-serif.",
      "Display typography leverages robust `clamp()` functions to fluidly scale from mobile to massive desktop viewports without requiring rigid CSS media queries at every step."
    ]
